Company Description:
NOTE: We do not provide visa nor accommodation. Make sure to only apply when you are already residing in the Netherlands.

Novotel Amsterdam City
Novotel Amsterdam City is one of the largest 4‑star hotels in the Netherlands. As a strong and trusted brand within the international Accor group, we offer 610 guest rooms, 1,300 m&sup2; of meeting facilities, and several vibrant F&B outlets. Every day, we welcome more than 500 guests and take pride in delivering the exceptional service they deserve.
Are you service‑minded and ready to take the next step in your hospitality career? Would you like to work in one of the largest hotels in the Benelux, surrounded by a young, spontaneous, and energetic team? Then this is the perfect opportunity for you.
At Novotel Amsterdam City, passion, quality, and professionalism are at the heart of everything we do. With genuine attention and an authentic approach, we ensure that our guests feel welcome and return with pleasure. You will be part of a close‑knit team of around 135 colleagues, where we know each other, support each other, and enjoy our work together.

